07:41:23.100 --> 07:41:26.780
That said, we understood why we have the six channels.

07:41:26.780 --> 07:41:29.140
Now, how do we obtain the 60 by 60?

07:41:29.140 --> 07:41:32.020
The way we obtain the 60 by 60 is by applying this formula,

07:41:32.020 --> 07:41:33.300
