07:41:43.620 --> 07:41:45.500
So pattern is zero, stride one.

07:41:45.500 --> 07:41:49.060
So we have 64 minus five and then plus one.

07:41:49.060 --> 07:41:53.200
This gives us 64 minus four, which is equal to 60.

07:41:53.200 --> 07:41:55.860
And that's how we have this output right here.

07:41:58.140 --> 07:42:02.660
From here, we move to the subsampling pooling layer.

