07:43:39.280 --> 07:43:41.900
That said, to obtain this, we have X.

07:43:41.900 --> 07:43:44.860
That is in this case, we have X equals 60.

07:43:44.860 --> 07:43:46.700
So let's take this off.

07:43:46.700 --> 07:43:51.700
