07:43:59.700 --> 07:44:03.640
So 60 minus two, 58 divided by two,

07:44:03.640 --> 07:44:07.240
29 plus one gives us 30.

07:44:07.240 --> 07:44:08.680
That's how we get this.

07:44:08.680 --> 07:44:10.620
We still maintain a number of channels.

07:44:11.720 --> 07:44:14.160
Here's another example showing even more clearly

