10:50:01.960 --> 10:50:04.760
So here we paste out the scheduler.

10:50:04.760 --> 10:50:06.960
Let's do this.

10:50:06.960 --> 10:50:08.440
And then for this one,

10:50:08.440 --> 10:50:13.440
we have our learning rate scheduling callback.

10:50:15.000 --> 10:50:19.000
So learning rate scheduler.

10:50:19.000 --> 10:50:21.200
And then we do this import.

10:50:21.200 --> 10:50:25.680
So here again, we just have learning rate scheduler.

10:50:25.680 --> 10:50:30.680
We run that and then get back to this position right here.

10:50:31.240 --> 10:50:33.240
