14:25:11.500 --> 14:25:14.380
So in fact, what we're saying is if you have a big function

14:25:14.380 --> 14:25:17.740
and you have this function,

14:25:17.740 --> 14:25:21.420
say let's say we have A equal

14:25:21.420 --> 14:25:24.340
a function call to small function.

