14:27:24.900 --> 14:27:26.620
a graph data structure.

14:27:26.620 --> 14:27:31.180
So we have this graph, we have this nodes

14:27:31.180 --> 14:27:34.020
which have been linked to one another.

14:27:34.020 --> 14:27:37.580
And so when we write code, input output.

14:27:37.580 --> 14:27:39.900
So when we write code like this

14:27:39.900 --> 14:27:42.540
and it's converted into this graph format,

14:27:43.580 --> 14:27:47.180
the very first time we make a call on this method,

14:27:47.180 --> 14:27:49.860
