14:27:54.660 --> 14:27:58.020
And then the next time we make this call,

14:27:58.020 --> 14:28:00.420
since in the graph mode, we basically storing

14:28:00.420 --> 14:28:04.500
this operations and the data that's gonna be passed

14:28:04.500 --> 14:28:07.180
in between the operations,

14:28:07.180 --> 14:28:10.740
we are gonna focus on only this portion

14:28:10.740 --> 14:28:14.220
of this method right here.

14:28:14.220 --> 14:28:17.220
So this print is not gonna be taken into consideration

14:28:17.220 --> 14:28:21.360
for the second time and for any other time.

14:28:21.360 --> 14:28:25.180
So that said, we could run this for as many times

14:28:25.180 --> 14:28:28.220
as we wish and we wouldn't.

14:28:28.220 --> 14:28:31.460
Okay, let's take this back to the graph mode.

