So this is the eager mode,

14:28:33.860 --> 14:28:34.980
taking it back to the graph mode,

14:28:34.980 --> 14:28:37.440
you see it's gonna be printed only once.

14:28:37.440 --> 14:28:41.180
And then you could convert all the methods we're using

14:28:41.180 --> 14:28:44.360
