it's gonna be printed twice.

14:30:18.540 --> 14:30:20.860
Then from here, always ensure that if you turn

14:30:20.860 --> 14:30:25.180
away in the graph mode, make sure all your operations

14:30:25.180 --> 14:30:27.440
are tensor flow operations.

14:30:27.440 --> 14:30:32.100
So if you are able to resize, for example, with OpenCV,

14:30:32.940 --> 14:30:36.140
it's actually a good thing but you have to make sure

