15:49:17.820 --> 15:49:20.820
Now we should be noted that the method we've used so far

15:49:20.820 --> 15:49:23.820
is grid search, that is we've,

15:49:23.820 --> 15:49:26.820
specified those different ranges

15:49:26.820 --> 15:49:29.820
and then we've some sort of search

15:49:29.820 --> 15:49:32.820
through those different ranges

15:49:32.820 --> 15:49:35.820
and then we've gotten the best possible parameters

15:49:35.820 --> 15:49:40.820
which maximize the accuracy value.

15:49:40.820 --> 15:49:44.820
Now another very popular technique is the random search.

15:49:44.820 --> 15:49:48.820
With a random search, we'll just define a range

15:49:48.820 --> 15:49:51.820
and then pick our random values in that range.

15:49:51.820 --> 15:49:55.820
So unlike the grid search where we have some defined

15:49:55.820 --> 15:49:58.820
or predefined values which we have to search through,

15:49:58.820 --> 15:50:02.820
with a random search, we kind of like pick values at random.

15:50:02.820 --> 15:50:06.820
But then they both have the advantages and disadvantages.

15:50:06.820 --> 15:50:09.820
And one thing you could take out from this is that

15:50:09.820 --> 15:50:12.820
with a grid search, since you have a fixed range,

15:50:12.820 --> 15:50:15.820
so you have a fixed range of values

15:50:15.820 --> 15:50:18.820
which you can pick from, it means if this fixed range

15:50:18.820 --> 15:50:21.820
of values is very large, it becomes problematic

15:50:21.820 --> 15:50:24.820
as this process of searching is going to take

15:50:24.820 --> 15:50:26.820
a very long time.

15:50:26.820 --> 15:50:29.820
So you may take a very long time before finding

15:50:29.820 --> 15:50:33.820
your best hyperparameter values, which we connect.

15:50:33.820 --> 15:50:36.820
Whereas for the random search,

15:50:36.820 --> 15:50:39.820
since we're not going in a particular order,

15:50:39.820 --> 15:50:42.820
it happens that we may even get the best

15:50:42.820 --> 15:50:46.820
hyperparameter values after just one step.

15:50:46.820 --> 15:50:51.820
So after just one run or a few runs,

15:50:51.820 --> 15:50:54.820
we may already get the best hyperparameter values

15:50:54.820 --> 15:50:59.820
just like we may get these values after 200 different runs.

15:50:59.820 --> 15:51:02.820
So if you have enough computation power,

15:51:02.820 --> 15:51:04.820
you could make use of the grid search

15:51:04.820 --> 15:51:06.820
since you're more sure of the different values

15:51:06.820 --> 15:51:08.820
you're going to be picking from.

15:51:08.820 --> 15:51:11.820
And if not, the random search will be a better option.

